{title: Tis' So sweet to Trust in Jesus}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]Tis so sweet to [C]trust in [G]Jesus
And to take him [C]at his [D]word
[G]Just to rest [C]upon his [G]promise
[G]And to [C]know, "Thus [Dsus4]saith [D]the [G]Lord."

{comment: Chorus}
[G]Jesus, Jesus, [C]how I [D]trust him!
[G]How I've proved him [C]o'er and [D]o'er!
[G]Jesus, Jesus, [C]precious [G]Jesus!
[G]O for [C]grace to [D]trust him [G]more!

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]O how sweet to [C]trust in [G]Jesus,
Just to trust his [C]cleansing [D]blood
[G]And in simple [C]faith to [G]plunge me
[G]'neath the [C]healing, [Dsus4]cleansing [D][G]flood!

{comment: Verse 3}
[G]Yes, 'tis sweet to [C]trust in [G]Jesus
Just from sin and [C]self to [D]cease
[G]Just from Jesus [C]simply [G]taking
[G]Life and [C]rest, and [Dsus4]joy [D]and [G]peace

{comment: Verse 4}
[G]I'm so glad I [C]learned to [G]trust thee
Precious Jesus, [C]Savior, [D]friend
[G]And I know that [C]thou art [G]with me
[G]Wilt be [C]with me [Dsus4]to [D]the [G]end
